### An Eye for an I

My newest artwork translates my findings on large language models into an audiovisual piece, *An Eye for an I, The Change*. It was presented at the Charles Perkins Centre EMCR Symposium and at the Parramatta Lanes pop-up gallery.

::: {.credits}
